      en: ["Total area of 620 square kilometers", "Third largest island in Cape Verde", "Highest elevation is Monte Estância at 387m", "Major global nesting site for loggerhead turtles", "Home to the Viana Desert and its sand dunes", "Historically significant for its salt exports"],
