      en: ["Named after the nurse sharks (gatas) once found there.", "Host to a major music festival since 1984.", "Protected by a natural volcanic rock barrier reef.", "Located approximately 12 km northeast of Mindelo.", "Formed within a partially submerged volcanic crater.", "The music festival occurs annually during August's full moon."],
